# promise: #784
# A Favorite closed with ⌘W leaves ⌃Tab's switcher, as in Arc 1.174.2 (measured 26 Nov 2026: listed before ⌘W, gone
# after), though its page keeps running (#740). Picked again, it's back in the list. isabhiii on #784.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=2
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=fav
wait 2
cra://action/favoriteTab
wait 1
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 3 cards: Fixture fav, Fixture 2, Fixture 1
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://action/closeTab
expect-log close tab: favorite deselected, its page kept
wait 2
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 2 cards: Fixture 2, Fixture 1
reject-log tab switcher: 2 cards: .*Fixture fav
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://debug?selectTab=n=fav
wait 2
cra://debug?switcher=1
expect-log tab switcher: 3 cards: Fixture fav, Fixture 2, Fixture 1
cra://dismiss
